{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778903358234,"sessionID":"ses_1d12025efffeu0DQn1YOcjJIQi","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-b8b6c1926fe3d036","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"## Summary of Changes\nRemoved several incorrect synonyms from MONDO:0001628 (tinea unguium) that referred to cellulitis and abscesses in various body parts. These synonyms were identified as mistakes and were likely imported from DOID:13074.\n\n## Rationale\nTinea unguium is a fungal infection of the nails. Cellulitis and abscesses of the buttock, face, gluteal region, trunk, and upper arm/forearm are not synonyms for a nail fungal infection.\n\n## Validation\n- Verified the current state of MONDO:0001628 using `obo-grep.pl`.\n- Edited the term using `obo-checkout.pl` and `obo-checkin.pl`.\n- Ran `make NORM` to ensure the serialization is correct.\n- Committed the changes locally.\n","filePath":"/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"PR_COMMENTS.md","time":{"start":1778903358226,"end":1778903358232}},"id":"prt_e2ee68c68001cBNlfXGgVhNq84","sessionID":"ses_1d12025efffeu0DQn1YOcjJIQi","messageID":"msg_e2ee6884c001epsbqAP7q7jh3l"}}
