{"type":"text","timestamp":1778903394156,"sessionID":"ses_1d12025efffeu0DQn1YOcjJIQi","part":{"id":"prt_e2ee72077001UAsJS2Ue29D9oJ","messageID":"msg_e2ee71c06001mAXf2yODZPIOgM","sessionID":"ses_1d12025efffeu0DQn1YOcjJIQi","type":"text","text":"I have addressed issue #10030 by removing the incorrect synonyms related to cellulitis and abscesses from MONDO:0001628 (tinea unguium).\n\n**Changes performed:**\n1.  Identified and verified the incorrect synonyms in `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo`.\n2.  Checked out the term using `obo-checkout.pl`.\n3.  Removed the following synonyms:\n    - `cellulitis and abscess`\n    - `cellulitis and abscess of buttock`\n    - `cellulitis and abscess of face`\n    - `cellulitis and abscess of finger`\n    - `cellulitis and abscess of finger and toe`\n    - `cellulitis and abscess of gluteal region`\n    - `cellulitis and abscess of trunk`\n    - `cellulitis and abscess of upper arm and forearm`\n4.  Checked the term back in and normalized the ontology using `make NORM`.\n5.  Committed the changes locally.\n6.  Created `ISSUE_COMMENTS.md` and `PR_COMMENTS.md`.","time":{"start":1778903359607,"end":1778903394153}}}
